# Assets to pack into the encrypted client asset archive (clientassets.pak).
#
# Each non-empty, non-comment line is a path or wildcard relative to the
# Resources directory. Wildcards are matched recursively.
#
# Examples:
#   *.png
#   MainMenu/*.png
#   Icons/Sides/*.png
#   Audio/SE/*.wav
#
# By default every PNG under Resources is packed. Comment this out and list
# individual paths if only a subset of images should be archived.
*.png
